 "about": "The normalizer of the animation world (specification section 19.1): the diagram world's table (training/worlds/diagram/normalize.json) with the temporal expressions added and one rule removed ('over' -> 'above': in this world 'over' introduces a duration, 'over two seconds'). Deterministic, applied before the reader in Python (normalize.py, used by generate.py and animation_scripts.py) and in JavaScript (app/src/normalize.js with this table as app/model/animation/normalize.json). Order as in the diagram world: quoted labels, lower-case, contractions, multi-word expressions (longest first), single-word synonyms, number words to digits, punctuation split. Time units become 's' and 'ms'; 'twice' becomes '2 times'; 'one' is still never converted, except in 'one second'.",
